{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>When a ruler sins.</b> Meaning, even through a ruling of the court, whenever the court itself is not liable and he acted, he is liable a goat. And so the Rambam writes (Hilkhot Shegagot 15:8)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "The verse lemma cites Numbers 35:24 (אשר נשיא יחטא) rather than the actual Leviticus 4:22 text (אשר נשיא יחטא); rendered as the commentary's lemma. The Rambam citation likely refers to Hilkhot Shegagot 1:15 or chapter 14, not 15:8."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:53:03.855026362Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}